        "latex": "Y_{c}\\left(j\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ a_{T}\\left(j\\right)=2\\lor a_{T}\\left(j\\right)=3\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle -h_{T}\\left(i_{T}\\left(j\\right)\\right)\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle h_{T}\\left(i_{T}\\left(j\\right)\\right)\\right.\\end{array}",
