        "h": 32,
        "latex": "Y_{T}\\left(j\\right)\\coloneq Y_{c}\\left(j\\right)+\\delta_{w}\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi\\alpha_{T}\\left(j\\right)}{180}\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}L_{w}o_{T}\\left(j\\right)",
