        "latex": "X_{L}\\left(j\\right)\\coloneq k_{L}\\left(j\\right)\\left(2a_{L}\\left(j\\right)-1\\right)a_{x}+\\delta_{w}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi\\alpha_{L}\\left(j\\right)}{180}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}L_{w}p_{x}\\left(j\\right)",
