      "y": 18188,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strain plane, stress laws and section resultants",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2,
        "annex": {
          "kind": "heading",
          "id": "ax_resultants"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 18231,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "c = neutral-axis depth below the compression face; p = fibre coordinate from the centroid,",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 18271,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "positive towards the compression face; H = section depth in that direction; dt = depth of the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 18311,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "extreme bar. The strain plane pivots about A (bar at −εud), B (face at εcu2) or C (εc2 at",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 18351,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "(1 − εc2/εcu2)·H), whichever governs for the depth c (EC2 Fig. 6.1). Compression positive.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 18923,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Strain at fibre p",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9q",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 18816,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon\\left(c,p,H,d_{t}\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ c<\\frac{\\varepsilon_{cu2}d_{t}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}+\\varepsilon_{ud}}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{ud}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{d_{t}-c}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ c\\le H\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{cu2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{c2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon_{c2}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}}\\right)H}\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19123,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Concrete stress, parabola-rectangle (EC2 3.17), no tension",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9s",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 19056,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{c}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon\\le0\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle 0\\,\\mathrm{MPa}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon<\\varepsilon_{c2}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{cd}\\left(1-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_{c2}}\\right)^2\\right)\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{cd}\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19303,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Steel stress, elastic-plastic within ±fyd",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9u",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 19236,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{s}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon<-f_{yd}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle -f_{yd}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon>f_{yd}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{yd}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle E_{s}\\varepsilon\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19382,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "For a neutral-axis direction β (normal of the axis, towards the compression face):",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19423,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Section depth along β",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9x",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 19416,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "H_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)\\coloneq b\\left|\\cos\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right|+h\\left|\\sin\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right|",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19463,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Depth of the extreme bar",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_9z",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 19489,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "d_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)\\coloneq\\frac{H_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)}{2}-\\min\\left(x_{s}\\cos\\left(\\beta\\right)+y_{s}\\sin\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
